OL,3,GNEWSAKeegan tribute display sees
OL,4,Athousands of visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn exhibition featuring hundreds of
OL,7,Fshirts left outside Newcastle's stadium
OL,8,Fin tribute to Kevin Keegan has seen
OL,9,Fthousands of visitors.
OL,11,FFlowers, cards, shirts and scarves were
OL,12,Fplaced at St James' Park by fans of the
OL,13,Ffootballing legend in the days
OL,14,Ffollowing his death on 20 July at the
OL,15,Fage of 75.
OL,17,FA free event at the Baltic Centre for
OL,18,FContemporary Art last weekend, which
OL,19,Ffeatured a 57ft (17.5m) banner designed
OL,20,Fby fan group Wor Flags and a
OL,21,Fcommemorative film celebrating Keegan,
OL,22,Fsaw 3,805 people visit.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
