OL,3,GNEWSAKeegan tribute display sees
OL,4,Athousands of visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FDesigner Dan Lycett said it was his
OL,7,F"most stressful" display so far because
OL,8,Fof what Keegan meant to him, saying:
OL,9,F"He was my hero so I had to get it
OL,10,Fright."
